WEBVTT

00:00:00.516 --> 00:00:01.208
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.109 --> 00:00:04.224
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m seeing Jessica at six.

00:00:04.899 --> 00:00:06.269
<v><b>B:</b></v> She<b>’ll</b> be late.

00:00:07.721 --> 00:00:08.895
<v><b>A:</b></v> The film’s in French.

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:10.596
We <b>won’t understand</b> anything.

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.225
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.302 --> 00:00:15.204
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> It’s a great book.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.706
I’m sure you<b>’ll like</b> it.

00:00:18.328 --> 00:00:20.373
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I don’t think it<b>’ll rain</b> tomorrow.